        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Fireworks（指尖烟花）</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE! CROUCH! BOOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only move to adjacent keys. Moving over keys will make you trip and fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and hold your current key to crouch and light the fuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crucial!</strong> After igniting the fuse, make sure to escape the danger zone before it explodes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Fireworks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fireworks light up the sky, press and hold the SPACE to look up and enjoy the show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> You'll earn bonus points for watching!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random tiles will break! Stepping on them will make you trip, fall, and lose points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your path! The aim is higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Fireworks（指尖烟花）</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE! CROUCH! BOOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/dadd25470c2f59860be6ee313d70ba85.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only move to adjacent keys. Moving over keys will make you trip and fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and hold your current key to crouch and light the fuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crucial!</strong> After igniting the fuse, make sure to escape the danger zone before it explodes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Fireworks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/a338d55e2245949d7477b11226f59d47.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fireworks light up the sky, press and hold the SPACE to look up and enjoy the show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> You'll earn bonus points for watching!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your step!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.poster.avif?t=1761272752\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.webm?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907060/extras/00b83d05efc455541c94d1da6540899e.mp4?t=1761272752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random tiles will break! Stepping on them will make you trip, fall, and lose points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your path! The aim is higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
